[TITLE]
;;Corrupt-coordinate fixture — the West Whiteland 2024 signature.
;;A compact network plus a few junctions flung ~4e7 units away by a
;;projection failure. The raw coordinate union is then ~2.4e7 x 7.0e7
;;around a network that really spans ~2,700 x 2,200, which used to
;;collapse LinkSpatialGrid to a single cell and make every query a
;;linear scan. Both the normal links AND the far ones must stay
;;hit-testable.

